[=#oracleloginattempts]
= Login Attempts =

After a failed login, the Oracle protocol module lets the client retry on the same connection, as a real Oracle server does.  The //maxloginattempts// option sets how many attempts a connection gets before it is dropped.  If unset or 0, it defaults to 3, matching Oracle's default.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@parts/sqlrelay-oraclefeloginattempts.conf@
